  "description": "SEPBOI crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C56 H80 Er4 N8 O22,2(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Er2 (Er) has 8 O neighbors; Er1 (Er) has 7 O neighbors; Er3 (Er) has 8 O neighbors; Er4 (Er) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.641-4.115 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 93.71-128.19°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C58H88Er4N8O24. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
